<LanguageData>
    <!-- A slave restraint specifically designed to confine a Mugirl's hands, securing them together behind her back. When combined with specially designed slave gauntlets, even finger movement becomes impossible, rendering her completely helpless against any action taken against her. The restraint features a dedicated locking mechanism that can only be opened with a [Rough Restraint Key]. -->
    <MooGirl_Armbinder.description>一种专门限制雪牛娘双手的奴隶束具，将雪牛娘的双手固定在背后并并拢，配合特质的奴隶手套甚至连手指都无法活动，这下无论对雪牛娘做什么她都无法反抗。\n\n束具配有专用锁具，必须使用[粗糙束具钥匙]才能解开。</MooGirl_Armbinder.description>
    <!-- Mugirl Armbinder Restraint -->
    <MooGirl_Armbinder.label>雪牛娘 单手套束具</MooGirl_Armbinder.label>
    <!-- A slave restraint specifically designed to confine a Mugirl's arms, using multiple handcuffs and leather straps to secure her hands behind her back. When combined with specially designed slave gauntlets, even finger movement becomes impossible, rendering her completely helpless against any action taken against her. The restraint features a dedicated locking mechanism that can only be opened with a [Rough Restraint Key]. -->
    <MooGirl_Boxbinder.description>一种专门限制雪牛娘手臂的奴隶束具，多重手铐与皮带将雪牛娘的双手束缚在身后，配合特质的奴隶手套甚至连手指都无法活动，这下无论对雪牛娘做什么她都无法反抗。\n\n束具配有专用锁具，必须使用[粗糙束具钥匙]才能解开。</MooGirl_Boxbinder.description>
