    <!-- A slave restraint specifically designed to confine a Mugirl's hands, using heavy shackles to secure them in front of her body. When combined with specially designed slave gauntlets, even finger movement becomes impossible, rendering her completely helpless against any action taken against her. The restraint features a dedicated locking mechanism that can only be opened with a [Rough Restraint Key]. -->
    <MooGirl_Handcuffs.description>一种专门限制雪牛娘双手的奴隶束具，笨重的枷锁将雪牛娘的双手束缚在身前，配合特质的奴隶手套甚至连手指都无法活动，这下无论对雪牛娘做什么她都无法反抗。\n\n束具配有专用锁具，必须使用[粗糙束具钥匙]才能解开。</MooGirl_Handcuffs.description>
