    <!-- A high-heeled boot-style restraint that limits movement speed. The wearer cannot remove them independently, though her gait appears to become more graceful. When combined with specially designed slave stockings, the restraint is further enhanced, rendering her completely helpless against any action taken against her. The restraint features a dedicated locking mechanism that can only be opened with a [Rough Restraint Key]. -->
    <MooGirl_Slaveboots.description>一种高跟鞋型的束缚靴，限制其移动速度。穿戴者无法自行脱下，但步态似乎变得更加优雅。配合特质的奴隶袜会进一步强化束缚，这下无论对雪牛娘做什么她都无法反抗。\n\n束具配有专用锁具，必须使用[粗糙束具钥匙]才能解开。</MooGirl_Slaveboots.description>
